WEBVTT

01:29.700 --> 01:31.620
[Blood River]

01:31.620 --> 01:33.980
[Based on the novel of the same name from Zhou Munan's Youth in Jianghu series]

01:33.980 --> 01:35.980
[Available on fanqienovel.com & bkneng.com]

01:36.380 --> 01:38.980
[Episode 9]

01:43.230 --> 01:43.820
Sir.

01:45.230 --> 01:46.050
The Dormant Dragon Sword!

01:55.560 --> 01:56.570
Why is the Dormant Dragon Sword here?

02:00.120 --> 02:02.020
Each Patriarch of Blood River

02:02.760 --> 02:04.690
holds two Dormant Dragon Swords.

02:05.430 --> 02:06.180
The two blades

02:07.040 --> 02:08.940
were forged from the same meteoric iron.

02:09.560 --> 02:10.540
The only difference is,

02:11.630 --> 02:13.100
the one in my hand

02:13.840 --> 02:16.170
hides Blood River's secret.

02:16.960 --> 02:18.220
The other one is in your hand.

02:18.870 --> 02:21.060
If Su Jinhui can truly wield it,

02:22.080 --> 02:23.170
we'll wait until he quells

02:23.240 --> 02:24.260
the turmoil in Blood River.

02:24.710 --> 02:25.410
Then,

02:26.000 --> 02:27.010
I will hand this blade

02:27.560 --> 02:28.380
to him as well.

02:29.120 --> 02:30.260
If he cannot,

02:31.400 --> 02:32.820
then that sword

02:33.400 --> 02:35.340
will fully ignite

02:35.710 --> 02:37.540
the three family heads' ambitions.

02:38.840 --> 02:39.730
And those men

02:40.310 --> 02:41.060
will in the end

02:41.190 --> 02:43.260
be consumed by their own ambition!

02:45.680 --> 02:47.060
Only when they step back

02:48.710 --> 02:50.610
will the more promising young

02:51.080 --> 02:52.660
have a chance to rise,

02:53.870 --> 02:54.610
a chance

02:56.000 --> 02:58.220
to break free.

03:04.140 --> 03:06.500
[Luojiuxiao Inn]

04:00.630 --> 04:01.610
Given he's that smart,

04:02.870 --> 04:04.940
he must know this Fingertip Blade is missing,

04:06.190 --> 04:07.290
and that I took it.

04:08.680 --> 04:09.570
But...

04:11.150 --> 04:12.100
he didn't ask for it back.

04:13.960 --> 04:14.940
That's tacit approval.

04:20.390 --> 04:21.170
Then...

04:25.240 --> 04:26.700
does that make it a token of love?

04:36.390 --> 04:37.020
You're awake.

04:38.630 --> 04:39.780
What took you so long to get back?

04:40.640 --> 04:41.690
You were gone forever.

04:41.800 --> 04:42.810
I'm starving.

04:47.310 --> 04:48.580
If you're fine, go down and eat.

04:52.240 --> 04:53.220
Who says I'm fine?

04:55.120 --> 04:56.580
I still need someone to look after me.

05:22.480 --> 05:24.220
I haven't fully recovered.

05:25.000 --> 05:25.850
How about...

05:27.510 --> 05:28.250
you feed me?

05:42.310 --> 05:43.700
Why are you so nice to me today?

05:44.870 --> 05:45.410
Eat properly.

05:45.830 --> 05:46.490
No talking.

05:48.600 --> 05:49.290
Got it.

05:51.040 --> 05:51.700
You...

05:53.830 --> 05:54.490
you're leaving?

05:57.920 --> 05:58.980
I was always going to leave.

06:00.600 --> 06:01.290
Besides,

06:03.680 --> 06:04.900
you're almost healed.

06:57.040 --> 06:58.250
You're here.

06:59.040 --> 07:00.250
You knew I'd come?

07:02.720 --> 07:04.930
You're a lot like me when I was young.

07:06.190 --> 07:07.540
When you were young,

07:08.600 --> 07:09.850
were you already such a piece of work?

07:16.160 --> 07:17.100
You seem

07:17.680 --> 07:19.700
to hate showing

07:20.430 --> 07:22.220
your truest self.

07:23.360 --> 07:26.170
Afraid of being seen through?

07:29.430 --> 07:30.850
Before,

07:31.680 --> 07:33.540
I kept you down,

07:34.120 --> 07:35.460
and you didn't dare raise your head.

07:36.630 --> 07:38.850
Now that my edge is gone,

07:40.510 --> 07:41.730
do you feel

07:42.040 --> 07:43.930
your chance has come?

07:46.310 --> 07:47.780
Since you so enjoy

07:47.780 --> 07:48.470
reading people's minds,

07:48.470 --> 07:49.580
why not take a guess

07:50.800 --> 07:51.580
why I came

07:52.440 --> 07:53.910
and what's my plan?

07:54.240 --> 07:55.140
You want

07:55.720 --> 07:58.460
the head of the Su family.

08:01.830 --> 08:02.700
Su Changhe,

08:03.630 --> 08:05.700
you're merely the Nameless.

08:05.800 --> 08:07.810
Nameless Su Muyu

08:09.750 --> 08:12.850
has no right to inherit the Patriarch.

08:13.070 --> 08:14.170
You as well

08:14.480 --> 08:15.610
have no right to inherit

08:15.800 --> 08:18.220
the head of the Su family.

08:24.160 --> 08:25.250
So you did look down on me.

08:27.560 --> 08:29.540
The title of Su family head

08:30.750 --> 08:32.060
doesn't interest me.

08:33.390 --> 08:34.100
What I want is something

08:35.200 --> 08:37.060
Blood River has never seen done

08:37.390 --> 08:39.010
in past centuries.

08:40.510 --> 08:41.370
What I aim to achieve

08:42.270 --> 08:43.370
is a vow

08:43.390 --> 08:45.100
no one in Blood River could even imagine.

08:48.720 --> 08:49.460
I...

08:50.960 --> 08:52.300
will change Blood River.

09:02.320 --> 09:03.010
Good.

09:05.390 --> 09:06.130
Changhe,

09:07.030 --> 09:09.340
your Inch Sword

09:09.600 --> 09:10.940
is impressive.

09:11.960 --> 09:13.530
But beating me

09:14.670 --> 09:15.580
won't be easy.

09:18.790 --> 09:21.010
My sword may be broken,

09:22.080 --> 09:22.890
but I

09:23.910 --> 09:24.850
am still

09:25.720 --> 09:27.300
Su Jinhui.

09:33.320 --> 09:34.130
Just a declawed tiger,

09:34.750 --> 09:35.610
a blind dragon,

09:36.670 --> 09:37.650
nothing to worry about.

09:50.080 --> 09:50.980
Nice moves.

09:53.600 --> 09:54.370
Back then,

09:55.080 --> 09:56.820
if not for the Su family's help,

09:57.480 --> 09:59.340
you two would've been dead.

10:00.390 --> 10:01.340
At Wailing Abyss,

10:01.440 --> 10:02.460
Muyu carried me out on his back.

10:03.080 --> 10:04.010
Patriarch took the strike,

10:04.200 --> 10:05.180
and that was his choice.

10:09.000 --> 10:10.180
We had no choice

10:10.200 --> 10:11.180
entering Blood River.

10:13.080 --> 10:14.940
But we'll step onto the other shore ourselves.

10:16.270 --> 10:16.890
And you...

10:18.080 --> 10:19.300
is a relic of the old era.

10:24.910 --> 10:25.580
You're wounded inside,

10:26.000 --> 10:26.980
no match for us.

10:27.440 --> 10:28.450
Su Changli...

10:28.600 --> 10:29.420
The tide in Blood River

10:30.510 --> 10:31.340
is turning.

10:37.600 --> 10:39.010
Uncle Qiu, are you thinking

10:40.080 --> 10:41.770
it'd be better if the master showed up?

10:43.200 --> 10:44.400
You've run

10:44.400 --> 10:45.460
so many celestial-rank missions.

10:46.150 --> 10:47.220
You never move

10:47.630 --> 10:49.100
without a sure win.

10:50.630 --> 10:51.490
I bet

10:51.510 --> 10:52.730
you've waited long for this.

10:53.270 --> 10:54.490
And this time,

10:55.240 --> 10:56.770
the result will be the same as always.

10:57.390 --> 10:58.890
You really do know me.

11:01.030 --> 11:02.420
How touching.

11:06.480 --> 11:08.430
I spent six full years

11:08.430 --> 11:10.000
gathering this organization.

11:10.320 --> 11:11.100
Its name...

11:12.840 --> 11:14.000
is The Other Shore.

11:18.550 --> 11:19.460
The Other Shore?

11:20.790 --> 11:22.220
You want to change Blood River?

11:22.510 --> 11:23.130
That's right.

11:24.240 --> 11:25.390
Cross Blood River

11:25.390 --> 11:26.460
and you reach the Other Shore.

11:27.720 --> 11:29.650
There should be no endless night,

11:30.790 --> 11:31.890
but light.

11:41.870 --> 11:43.700
Stirring, isn't it?

11:51.840 --> 11:53.200
You're one of this family,

11:54.080 --> 11:55.260
raised from birth

11:55.790 --> 11:57.630
as an assassin.

11:59.390 --> 12:00.370
Would anyone truly choose

12:00.480 --> 12:01.340
to be born

12:01.390 --> 12:02.940
a tool for killing?

12:03.840 --> 12:05.490
Why do others bask in sunlight

12:06.200 --> 12:07.490
while our three families

12:08.260 --> 12:09.730
must live in darkness?

12:11.960 --> 12:13.160
Have you really never wanted

12:13.160 --> 12:14.040
to change that?

12:15.200 --> 12:16.460
When I was forced as a child

12:16.460 --> 12:17.640
to learn the killing arts,

12:18.240 --> 12:19.610
of course I asked those things.

12:20.790 --> 12:21.980
But after all these years,

12:23.030 --> 12:23.820
our hands,

12:23.870 --> 12:25.340
are soaked in blood.

12:26.240 --> 12:26.940
What right do we have

12:27.150 --> 12:28.410
to talk of change?

12:28.440 --> 12:29.010
Exactly.

12:31.200 --> 12:32.360
Though I see you

12:32.360 --> 12:33.760
as a fellow traveler,

12:34.510 --> 12:36.180
I didn't give you this ring.

12:37.200 --> 12:39.180
Because though you're awake to it,

12:40.000 --> 12:41.840
you've long lost your nerve.

12:44.390 --> 12:45.180
We're different.

12:46.630 --> 12:47.420
We're still young.

12:48.440 --> 12:50.100
As the storybooks say,

12:50.910 --> 12:51.850
we're in our prime.

12:55.840 --> 12:56.560
We haven't strayed far

12:56.560 --> 12:57.820
from the age

12:57.820 --> 12:58.700
when blood runs hot.

12:59.600 --> 13:00.400
We still remember

13:00.400 --> 13:01.830
that undimmed youth's heart,

13:01.830 --> 13:02.530
youth's will.

13:05.030 --> 13:06.370
So long as a young heart

13:07.030 --> 13:08.580
still beats in our chest,

13:09.630 --> 13:10.490
we know no fear,

13:11.320 --> 13:12.010
no regret,

13:13.320 --> 13:14.100
no surrender.

13:28.910 --> 13:30.420
Did you kill Master Su?

13:31.360 --> 13:32.010
Uncle Qiu,

13:34.150 --> 13:35.060
you're a good man.

13:35.910 --> 13:37.400
In this filthy, stained

13:37.400 --> 13:38.170
Blood River,

13:38.170 --> 13:38.890
you're one of the few

13:39.510 --> 13:40.700
worthy of respect.

13:44.150 --> 13:45.060
The new Blood River

13:45.270 --> 13:46.650
has no place for Su Jinhui.

13:49.240 --> 13:49.980
He isn't dead.

13:50.960 --> 13:51.850
Take him and leave.

13:54.670 --> 13:55.530
Live well.

13:56.600 --> 13:57.420
Maybe one day,

13:58.240 --> 13:59.060
out in the jianghu,

13:59.150 --> 14:00.420
you'll hear "Blood River"

14:02.030 --> 14:02.980
and be surprised.

14:06.200 --> 14:07.010
All right.

14:08.720 --> 14:09.820
I'll be waiting.

14:15.150 --> 14:15.980
Farewell, Uncle Qiu.

14:23.660 --> 14:33.820
[Sword Qi Soars]

14:46.720 --> 14:47.130
Changhe,

14:47.390 --> 14:48.850
the rest of the Su disciples are secured.

14:52.960 --> 14:53.980
Why not kill him?

14:57.440 --> 14:58.060
Yeah.

14:59.080 --> 14:59.610
Why not?

15:00.550 --> 15:01.820
What's our next move?

15:02.960 --> 15:03.820
head to the Mu family,

15:04.720 --> 15:05.820
and strike when we can?

15:06.670 --> 15:07.610
Where did Su Muyu go?

15:08.390 --> 15:09.490
He returned to the Spider's Nest.

15:10.510 --> 15:11.700
Then we'll go to the Spider's Nest.

15:17.440 --> 15:18.820
Mu Ciling took the Dormant Dragon Sword.

15:19.360 --> 15:20.530
It's in Mu hands now.

15:21.150 --> 15:22.530
What good is the Spider's Nest then?

15:23.200 --> 15:23.940
The Xie family

15:24.440 --> 15:25.820
has already ringed the Mu compound.

15:26.480 --> 15:27.440
Why don't we wait

15:27.440 --> 15:28.400
until they bleed each other,

15:28.400 --> 15:29.340
and snatch the Dormant Dragon Sword?

15:30.390 --> 15:31.580
Since The Other Shore formed,

15:32.840 --> 15:34.460
we've prepped for this day.

15:35.630 --> 15:36.940
As our leader,

15:37.870 --> 15:39.650
you shouldn't play favorites now,

15:41.200 --> 15:42.650
saving your brother's life.

15:46.870 --> 15:47.650
What did you say?

15:52.480 --> 15:53.290
War is upon us.

15:53.320 --> 15:54.240
Stay calm!

15:55.200 --> 15:56.340
If you kill me,

15:57.200 --> 15:58.490
what "new Blood River" is left?

15:59.150 --> 16:00.100
Do you plan

16:00.120 --> 16:01.140
to leave the Patriarch's position

16:01.140 --> 16:01.890
to him?

16:05.790 --> 16:07.130
Listen closely.

16:09.720 --> 16:10.980
With Su Muyu's nature,

16:11.200 --> 16:12.250
unless he's dead,

16:13.480 --> 16:14.460
he'll stop at nothing

16:14.480 --> 16:16.100
to run that sword down.

16:17.320 --> 16:18.090
Since he chose

16:18.090 --> 16:19.060
to return to the Spider's Nest

16:19.080 --> 16:20.180
instead of chasing Mu Ciling,

16:20.750 --> 16:21.500
that means

16:21.500 --> 16:22.870
there's a problem with that sword.

16:25.270 --> 16:26.730
Only a fool like Xie Ba

16:27.000 --> 16:27.940
will fight the Mus

16:28.030 --> 16:29.250
to the bitter end.

16:31.270 --> 16:32.700
If you're that stupid,

16:33.670 --> 16:34.580
then go and join him in death.

16:36.510 --> 16:37.010
Since that's so,

16:37.200 --> 16:37.940
the air's clear now.

16:38.270 --> 16:38.890
Why make a scene?

16:40.120 --> 16:41.010
- Changhe! - Besides...

16:42.600 --> 16:44.340
You were right about one thing.

16:45.240 --> 16:46.400
I'm keeping

16:46.400 --> 16:47.690
Su Muyu's life.

16:48.630 --> 16:49.940
Anyone else can die,

16:50.080 --> 16:51.300
but not him.

16:52.790 --> 16:54.530
No means no, unless...

16:56.030 --> 16:56.890
I die.

17:06.000 --> 17:07.140
Wait for me at the Spider's Nest gate.

17:07.400 --> 17:08.010
Yes.

17:10.980 --> 17:15.140
[Luojiuxiao Inn]

18:33.480 --> 18:34.440
Yin the Tiger.

18:34.840 --> 18:35.360
Sir.

18:35.820 --> 18:38.010
If things turn dire,

18:38.480 --> 18:39.650
take the miracle physician

18:39.790 --> 18:41.180
and get out first.

18:41.550 --> 18:42.090
Understood.

18:42.510 --> 18:43.090
Sir,

18:43.680 --> 18:44.520
do you think

18:44.550 --> 18:45.570
Su Muyu can't handle

18:45.570 --> 18:46.490
the ones outside?

18:48.680 --> 18:50.610
With his sword,

18:51.070 --> 18:52.940
Su Muyu is unstoppable.

18:53.750 --> 18:55.500
But in this world,

18:55.790 --> 18:58.050
one man and one sword

18:58.750 --> 18:59.940
can't change everything.

19:01.070 --> 19:02.090
But...

19:03.750 --> 19:04.980
We have a visitor.

19:08.510 --> 19:09.220
Who is he?

19:10.310 --> 19:12.050
Tang Lianyue of the Tang Clan.

19:13.070 --> 19:14.140
At last, we meet,

19:15.240 --> 19:16.700
Blood River's Patriarch.

19:19.880 --> 19:21.700
Xuanwu Guardian of Tianqi City,

19:23.790 --> 19:25.660
the honor is mine as well.

19:26.790 --> 19:28.380
Why does everyone

19:28.830 --> 19:29.810
call me

19:29.960 --> 19:31.250
the Xuanwu Guardian of Tianqi City?

19:31.680 --> 19:32.660
I just came to kill you

19:33.200 --> 19:34.770
to avenge my second uncle,

19:35.400 --> 19:36.770
not for Tianqi City.

19:39.550 --> 19:41.420
You're still too young.

19:42.680 --> 19:44.180
Your second uncle, Second Master Tang,

19:44.590 --> 19:46.530
left the jianghu long ago.

19:47.510 --> 19:49.620
He wouldn't even stay with the Tang Clan.

19:50.270 --> 19:51.220
He hid alone

19:52.110 --> 19:53.420
in bleak, remote

19:53.440 --> 19:54.820
Liaoluo City.

19:55.480 --> 19:56.460
Such a man...

19:57.160 --> 19:58.650
why would anyone

19:58.650 --> 20:00.810
ask me, Blood River's Patriarch,

20:01.200 --> 20:02.380
to personally kill him?

20:03.960 --> 20:05.050
Who hired you?

20:05.960 --> 20:07.490
Assassins don't name clients.

20:08.000 --> 20:08.770
That's the rule.

20:09.400 --> 20:10.330
I can only tell you one thing.

20:11.310 --> 20:12.400
Second Master Tang

20:12.550 --> 20:14.080
is who backs you most

20:14.160 --> 20:15.510
in the Tang Clan.

20:16.030 --> 20:17.700
They summoned you to Shuzhong,

20:17.700 --> 20:18.570
but you refused.

20:19.400 --> 20:20.420
Among the elders,

20:20.920 --> 20:22.110
only he

20:22.480 --> 20:24.180
stood with you.

20:25.310 --> 20:26.010
I see.

20:28.400 --> 20:29.700
Thanks for the reminder.

20:30.640 --> 20:31.900
But I'm still here to kill you

20:32.550 --> 20:33.330
to avenge him.

20:34.270 --> 20:36.050
Then by all means,

20:37.310 --> 20:38.700
take my life.

20:40.550 --> 20:41.210
Sir,

20:41.550 --> 20:43.420
you're in no shape to fight.

20:46.400 --> 20:48.010
If it's Blood River business,

20:48.510 --> 20:49.490
so be it.

20:51.310 --> 20:52.460
But this one

20:52.640 --> 20:54.490
is only my enemy.

20:55.240 --> 20:56.460
So I must answer personally.

20:57.590 --> 20:58.620
Besides,

20:58.880 --> 21:00.860
the Twelve Zodiacs aren't his match.

21:02.720 --> 21:05.570
Even a tiger near death

21:06.960 --> 21:08.250
has its pride,

21:09.200 --> 21:10.380
and a Patriarch

21:11.030 --> 21:12.380
his duty.

21:13.750 --> 21:14.380
No one move!

21:14.790 --> 21:15.330
Stand down.

21:23.920 --> 21:25.530
Show me your skill,

21:26.240 --> 21:27.010
Blossom...

21:27.830 --> 21:28.530
Shower!

21:33.030 --> 21:34.380
Someone acted before us.

21:34.750 --> 21:35.700
Do we go in now?

21:36.640 --> 21:37.290
Watch and wait.

21:37.880 --> 21:38.980
We'll move when Changhe returns.

21:40.310 --> 21:41.720
Truly my good brother.

21:41.830 --> 21:43.020
You do know me.

21:43.350 --> 21:44.410
Right before I do

21:44.410 --> 21:45.760
the most important thing,

21:45.810 --> 21:46.960
you asked to meet.

21:47.440 --> 21:48.380
I have something for you.

21:50.160 --> 21:51.250
If I may choose,

21:51.400 --> 21:52.490
I hope it's the Dormant Dragon Sword.

21:57.310 --> 21:58.330
Go to Tianqi City.

21:59.440 --> 22:00.960
Set foot there

22:01.180 --> 22:03.610
and someone will come for you.

22:04.240 --> 22:05.280
With your skill,

22:05.590 --> 22:06.810
you can slip past them

22:07.350 --> 22:08.880
and reach where your secret lies.

22:09.750 --> 22:10.910
Give these keys

22:11.550 --> 22:13.250
to the one who guards your secret.

22:13.960 --> 22:15.090
He will open the boxes

22:15.440 --> 22:16.650
meant for you

22:17.270 --> 22:19.410
and Su Changhe.

22:20.030 --> 22:20.900
From then on,

22:22.240 --> 22:23.330
your names

22:24.590 --> 22:25.980
within Blood River

22:26.030 --> 22:27.050
will be erased forever.

22:28.000 --> 22:28.530
Also,

22:29.110 --> 22:30.420
the secret you seek,

22:32.240 --> 22:34.570
the fall of No-Sword City,

22:35.680 --> 22:36.860
is inside.

22:41.350 --> 22:42.530
Is that truly what you want?

22:44.830 --> 22:45.660
To leave Blood River

22:47.270 --> 22:48.250
and claim real freedom.

22:49.110 --> 22:49.810
You fought so hard

22:50.000 --> 22:50.730
to shield the Patriarch

22:51.680 --> 22:52.940
just for these two keys?

22:56.270 --> 22:58.090
The three families' chaos is beyond repair.

22:58.920 --> 23:00.460
We can dissolve Blood River in the turmoil.

23:01.030 --> 23:02.700
Then we gain freedom

23:03.160 --> 23:04.680
and everyone

23:04.680 --> 23:05.570
gets a choice.

23:07.240 --> 23:08.770
So that was your plan.

23:09.880 --> 23:11.140
Use their infighting

23:12.070 --> 23:13.700
to drain the power-seekers,

23:14.920 --> 23:15.570
and finally,

23:16.270 --> 23:16.980
leave Blood River

23:16.980 --> 23:18.640
with those who think like you.

23:23.350 --> 23:24.450
Su Muyu.

23:26.000 --> 23:27.530
You're sharper than I thought.

23:30.240 --> 23:30.940
But...

23:34.680 --> 23:35.860
I have a gift

23:37.350 --> 23:38.140
for you too.

23:48.350 --> 23:49.090
The Other Shore?

23:50.750 --> 23:51.570
Cross Blood River

23:53.030 --> 23:54.010
and you reach the Other Shore.

23:56.000 --> 23:56.860
There should be

23:58.480 --> 23:59.420
no endless night,

24:00.830 --> 24:01.860
but light.

24:07.270 --> 24:08.470
Remember back then,

24:09.400 --> 24:10.530
when we finished a mission

24:11.030 --> 24:12.290
and passed the Canglan River,

24:13.440 --> 24:14.570
you stared at the water

24:14.570 --> 24:15.530
and asked me

24:16.590 --> 24:17.420
a question:

24:19.110 --> 24:21.010
when would we reach the Other Shore?

24:25.790 --> 24:27.050
I want to tell you now:

24:28.790 --> 24:29.730
it's tonight.

24:30.720 --> 24:31.570
But this night

24:33.070 --> 24:34.570
will be Blood River's night of blood.

24:35.350 --> 24:37.180
Blood is where change begins.

24:38.200 --> 24:38.900
Su Muyu,

24:39.720 --> 24:40.900
you're too kind.

24:41.920 --> 24:43.620
Everyone has a bottom line.

24:44.270 --> 24:46.010
Yours is even higher than my ceiling.

24:47.640 --> 24:49.120
It vexes me,

24:50.750 --> 24:52.180
and has for years.

24:55.750 --> 24:57.070
If you still mean to stop me,

24:57.590 --> 24:58.660
then let's fight.

24:59.640 --> 25:00.570
Winner calls it.

25:01.440 --> 25:02.090
If you win,

25:02.720 --> 25:03.860
I'll dissolve Blood River with you.

25:04.830 --> 25:05.530
If I win,

25:06.790 --> 25:07.770
you'll walk with me to the other shore.

25:08.350 --> 25:09.180
Changhe,

25:10.240 --> 25:11.770
no one knows you better than I do.

25:14.480 --> 25:16.140
You may lead Blood River to the light,

25:17.720 --> 25:18.730
but your ambition

25:19.240 --> 25:21.090
will also drive many into the abyss.

25:21.920 --> 25:22.600
And Blood River

25:22.600 --> 25:24.180
is not as simple as you think.

25:25.440 --> 25:27.220
Behind the Patriarch and the Soul Reapers' Hall,

25:28.350 --> 25:29.980
there's a stronger hand.

25:31.350 --> 25:32.250
Stronger?

25:32.960 --> 25:33.570
Yes.

25:35.200 --> 25:36.240
Even if we become

25:36.350 --> 25:38.250
Patriarch and head of the Su family,

25:39.110 --> 25:40.700
we won't rule it all.

25:41.270 --> 25:42.570
Even the Patriarch

25:43.680 --> 25:45.700
is just a blade in someone else's hand.

25:49.680 --> 25:51.440
If we can found a new Blood River,

25:53.070 --> 25:53.900
then that Blood River

25:54.200 --> 25:55.380
belongs only to the two of us.

25:56.790 --> 25:57.770
That hidden hand

25:58.400 --> 25:59.860
and those stubborn family heads

26:01.070 --> 26:02.840
will be cut down in the end.

26:03.550 --> 26:04.290
Su Muyu,

26:05.960 --> 26:07.380
when did you grow so timid?

26:11.110 --> 26:11.980
To stand against them,

26:12.830 --> 26:13.810
many will die,

26:14.830 --> 26:16.050
and the price will be heavy.

26:18.000 --> 26:18.980
I want them

26:19.160 --> 26:20.290
to survive.

26:21.000 --> 26:21.900
As you said,

26:23.680 --> 26:24.810
I'm an ambitious man.

26:26.440 --> 26:27.010
Unlike you,

26:28.070 --> 26:29.570
a free spirit.

26:31.000 --> 26:31.700
Su Muyu,

26:33.680 --> 26:34.490
we've always walked

26:34.550 --> 26:35.530
different paths!

26:49.680 --> 26:50.570
You say you'll be a good man

26:50.640 --> 26:51.530
in Blood River.

26:52.200 --> 26:53.010
That's naive.

26:55.200 --> 26:56.810
Those you won't kill, I'll kill.

26:57.510 --> 26:58.890
The sins you won't bear,

26:58.890 --> 26:59.870
I'll bear.

27:00.750 --> 27:01.980
Even if you want to leave Blood River,

27:03.750 --> 27:04.860
I'll pave the road for you.

27:06.550 --> 27:07.570
But if you die,

27:09.030 --> 27:10.220
I won't see you off,

27:13.790 --> 27:15.180
even if they call me the Undertaker.

27:18.400 --> 27:19.180
Do you remember

27:19.350 --> 27:20.490
what I told you

27:22.070 --> 27:23.250
when we escaped Wailing Abyss?

27:25.920 --> 27:27.050
If you're strong enough,

27:29.070 --> 27:30.140
you earn the right to be naive.

27:38.310 --> 27:39.140
And now,

27:42.070 --> 27:43.860
aren't I naive in my own way?

27:48.480 --> 27:49.450
Sword Deity Xueyue,

27:50.270 --> 27:51.360
what do you think?

27:54.400 --> 27:55.170
City Lord Li.

27:55.830 --> 27:56.990
Long time no see,

27:57.110 --> 27:57.860
Su Muyu.

27:59.590 --> 28:00.590
My junior says

28:00.910 --> 28:02.940
a new Patriarch in Blood River

28:03.070 --> 28:04.140
will shake the jianghu,

28:04.880 --> 28:06.530
so he invited me to judge.

28:07.680 --> 28:08.330
He says

28:09.200 --> 28:10.140
you're the best choice

28:10.960 --> 28:12.290
for Patriarch.

28:12.960 --> 28:14.240
Once I kill Mu Mingce,

28:14.350 --> 28:15.300
take the Dormant Dragon Sword,

28:15.960 --> 28:17.100
and unite the three families,

28:17.480 --> 28:18.460
he'll take it, want it or not.

28:23.720 --> 28:24.290
I believe you.

28:25.240 --> 28:26.360
Cruel as you can be,

28:26.960 --> 28:28.140
you keep your word.

28:29.640 --> 28:30.620
You've got a good eye.

28:31.510 --> 28:32.330
Hold him off for me.

28:32.830 --> 28:33.530
I'll handle business.

28:34.070 --> 28:35.140
But now I see

28:36.200 --> 28:37.250
an even better end.

28:37.830 --> 28:38.460
What?

28:39.680 --> 28:40.760
What Su Muyu said:

28:41.440 --> 28:42.480
dissolve Blood River.

28:43.400 --> 28:44.990
A jianghu without Blood River

28:46.400 --> 28:47.570
is truly best.

28:48.240 --> 28:48.940
Excellent.

28:54.920 --> 28:55.620
Trouble at the Nest.

28:56.350 --> 28:56.900
Changhe,

28:57.440 --> 28:58.440
your men acted?

28:59.300 --> 29:00.020
Without me,

29:00.310 --> 29:01.250
they wouldn't dare.

29:02.110 --> 29:02.860
It was Tang Lianyue.

29:03.480 --> 29:05.090
He's got his own vendetta.

29:14.440 --> 29:15.620
Skywrath Thunder!

29:16.200 --> 29:17.810
Shame the sky's clear tonight,

29:18.440 --> 29:19.570
or I'd call lightning down,

29:20.550 --> 29:21.250
and Sir,

29:21.920 --> 29:23.220
you'd already be dead.

29:36.310 --> 29:37.010
Sir.

29:38.200 --> 29:39.940
A blade is forged by grinding,

29:40.270 --> 29:42.010
and plum scent by bitter cold.

29:42.400 --> 29:43.140
That poison

29:43.400 --> 29:44.420
has one distinct trait:

29:45.000 --> 29:45.530
a resilience

29:45.680 --> 29:46.810
like the plum blossom.

29:47.680 --> 29:48.570
Even with antidote,

29:49.270 --> 29:50.860
if you stir inner force too soon,

29:51.200 --> 29:52.290
it'll surge back.

29:54.350 --> 29:55.180
Looks like

29:55.350 --> 29:56.010
the poison has relapsed.

29:56.400 --> 29:57.330
No need for me to strike,

29:58.200 --> 29:59.380
you'll die soon anyway.

30:01.110 --> 30:02.330
Freshly cured,

30:03.000 --> 30:03.730
after this fight,

30:04.270 --> 30:05.250
not even deities can save you.

30:06.110 --> 30:06.810
In that case,

30:07.590 --> 30:08.730
I'll take my leave.

30:09.270 --> 30:10.050
Sir, fare well

30:11.830 --> 30:13.570
on your way to the Underworld.

30:18.720 --> 30:19.250
Sir,

30:19.350 --> 30:20.660
we must treat it now.

30:22.920 --> 30:23.690
No need.

30:24.590 --> 30:26.040
I can feel

30:27.790 --> 30:29.180
my end is near.

30:30.550 --> 30:32.160
Even an immortal

30:33.750 --> 30:36.090
can't reverse it.

30:37.510 --> 30:38.220
Miracle physician,

30:39.270 --> 30:40.380
is there any other way?

30:41.830 --> 30:42.670
Freshly cleared of poison,

30:42.960 --> 30:44.460
he shouldn't have stirred the inner force.

30:45.070 --> 30:46.180
He could've lived a few more years.

30:47.680 --> 30:48.490
But just now...

30:49.200 --> 30:51.580
No need to blame yourself.

30:52.200 --> 30:53.810
My sins run deep.

30:54.440 --> 30:56.460
Even in the Underworld,

30:56.510 --> 30:57.660
before Yama,

30:58.270 --> 30:59.380
he'd judge me

31:00.200 --> 31:03.810
beyond saving.

31:05.110 --> 31:05.860
Sir...

31:11.510 --> 31:12.050
Muyu,

31:13.030 --> 31:13.860
Changhe,

31:15.240 --> 31:16.570
come with me.

31:17.920 --> 31:19.140
I have words for you.

31:20.400 --> 31:21.400
The rest of you,

31:21.880 --> 31:22.970
wait here.

31:23.480 --> 31:24.250
Understood.

31:41.510 --> 31:42.140
Muyu,

31:43.550 --> 31:44.800
I always thought

31:44.880 --> 31:46.980
you risked everything to protect me

31:48.400 --> 31:50.530
because of the Life-Death Contract.

31:51.270 --> 31:52.090
What contract?

31:53.310 --> 31:53.900
No matter.

31:54.680 --> 31:55.380
It's already undone.

31:56.960 --> 31:58.620
I used to think

32:00.000 --> 32:02.260
the world had cast me aside,

32:03.110 --> 32:04.950
until the day I learned

32:05.640 --> 32:07.290
you'd already cured the Life-Death Contract.

32:08.400 --> 32:09.420
I suddenly realized

32:09.960 --> 32:11.330
I'd underestimated you

32:12.680 --> 32:14.250
and myself.

32:15.310 --> 32:17.050
These years, I stayed by you

32:18.030 --> 32:18.940
because I believed

32:20.680 --> 32:21.860
you were worth guarding.

32:24.720 --> 32:25.290
Good.

32:27.000 --> 32:27.770
Very good.

32:28.790 --> 32:29.940
When I was young,

32:31.110 --> 32:32.810
Kewen and I were like brothers,

32:34.200 --> 32:35.700
like you and Changhe.

32:37.240 --> 32:39.510
Later, fighting for the Patriarch's position,

32:40.350 --> 32:41.570
I lost much.

32:42.590 --> 32:43.900
And Kewen alone

32:44.920 --> 32:45.980
came to this Spider's Nest.

32:48.830 --> 32:49.940
I thought

32:50.750 --> 32:51.940
he'd abandoned me too,

32:53.160 --> 32:53.860
yet in the end

32:55.550 --> 32:56.290
he gave his life

32:57.640 --> 32:59.430
to save me.

33:05.590 --> 33:06.330
Sadly,

33:07.720 --> 33:08.380
some things

33:09.550 --> 33:10.530
don't change,

33:13.270 --> 33:14.220
ever.

33:17.400 --> 33:18.010
Muyu,

33:20.200 --> 33:22.210
you have your own plan, don't you?

33:23.110 --> 33:24.290
Your ultimate aim

33:25.030 --> 33:26.290
is to dissolve Blood River,

33:27.310 --> 33:27.980
right?

33:30.110 --> 33:30.730
Yes.

33:31.830 --> 33:33.220
If I leave alone,

33:34.720 --> 33:36.420
those of the Spider Shadow won't meet a good end.

33:37.830 --> 33:38.710
I don't want them

33:38.710 --> 33:39.980
living in killing every day.

33:41.830 --> 33:42.810
Only by disbanding Blood River

33:44.750 --> 33:46.420
can they gain real freedom,

33:48.000 --> 33:49.130
live like ordinary folk

33:49.920 --> 33:51.460
and walk in the sun.

33:53.720 --> 33:55.460
If Blood River scatters like rain,

33:57.070 --> 33:59.090
no matter how strong those powers are,

34:01.070 --> 34:02.380
it won't matter.

34:07.110 --> 34:07.730
And you,

34:08.360 --> 34:08.980
Changhe?

34:09.630 --> 34:11.490
You want to command Blood River

34:12.480 --> 34:13.380
to change it,

34:13.920 --> 34:14.530
right?

34:15.230 --> 34:16.740
There's much I want to change.

34:18.360 --> 34:19.820
This is only a start.

34:28.510 --> 34:30.380
I can hand you this sword,

34:33.030 --> 34:34.130
though I'd rather

34:35.400 --> 34:36.530
give it to Muyu.

34:43.190 --> 34:44.300
When I was young,

34:45.760 --> 34:47.650
I thought as you do.

34:48.550 --> 34:49.570
But for now,

34:50.280 --> 34:51.340
you don't yet know.

34:52.000 --> 34:52.900
The cause you seek to achieve

34:53.360 --> 34:54.490
will be far harder

34:55.070 --> 34:56.300
than you imagine.

34:57.630 --> 34:58.690
The ones you must defeat

34:59.230 --> 35:00.490
aren't just Su Jinhui,

35:01.070 --> 35:02.130
nor only me,

35:04.840 --> 35:07.110
but ones stronger than us

35:07.150 --> 35:09.190
and many times more fearsome.

35:09.760 --> 35:11.090
Together, Su Muyu and I

35:11.150 --> 35:12.370
have yet to lose.

35:13.550 --> 35:14.940
The Soul Reapers' Hall

35:16.070 --> 35:17.050
isn't worth a mention.

35:18.630 --> 35:19.870
The Soul Reapers' Hall

35:21.590 --> 35:22.610
is only a puppet

35:23.110 --> 35:25.050
they planted in Blood River.

35:26.640 --> 35:28.050
For centuries,

35:28.360 --> 35:29.710
all know

35:30.000 --> 35:31.440
Blood River is the most fearsome

35:31.440 --> 35:33.330
under heaven.

35:33.840 --> 35:35.540
But the truth of it

35:36.960 --> 35:39.010
is hid even from its

35:40.030 --> 35:40.860
own killers

35:41.590 --> 35:42.940
Then what is the true face

35:44.440 --> 35:45.380
of Blood River?

35:46.920 --> 35:48.310
The truth

35:49.150 --> 35:51.840
can't be told in a few words.

35:52.190 --> 35:52.940
The secret hides

35:53.800 --> 35:55.740
in the secret passage in my room.

35:56.320 --> 35:57.380
After I'm gone,

35:57.760 --> 35:58.860
you're free to see it.

36:00.110 --> 36:01.780
But even if you don't,

36:02.400 --> 36:03.440
when you finally wield

36:04.590 --> 36:07.110
this Dormant Dragon Sword,

36:08.110 --> 36:10.420
they'll come for you.

36:19.230 --> 36:19.860
The sword's here.

36:21.230 --> 36:22.610
I leave it to you two.

36:24.960 --> 36:25.610
Sir...

36:36.030 --> 36:36.650
Muyu,

36:39.230 --> 36:40.210
I've always felt this way.

36:43.510 --> 36:45.650
Since I became Patriarch,

36:46.710 --> 36:47.340
I held

36:48.510 --> 36:51.520
Blood River's highest power

36:52.070 --> 36:53.120
and glory.

36:55.070 --> 36:56.510
But I was like a ghost

36:56.510 --> 36:58.690
cast aside by the three families.

37:00.000 --> 37:01.300
Only days ago,

37:02.630 --> 37:04.420
seeing Kewen die for me,

37:08.190 --> 37:09.010
seeing you

37:10.510 --> 37:12.090
choose to shield me

37:12.190 --> 37:14.090
even after my poison was cleared,

37:18.230 --> 37:19.090
did I realize

37:22.630 --> 37:24.300
I was never alone.

37:26.840 --> 37:27.460
Muyu,

37:30.190 --> 37:31.530
thanks for staying by my side

37:33.320 --> 37:34.260
all these years.

37:40.030 --> 37:41.210
If not for your kindness back then,

37:41.800 --> 37:42.420
the two of us

37:42.590 --> 37:43.570
would never have left Wailing Abyss.

37:54.550 --> 37:55.380
Back then,

37:57.190 --> 37:58.340
I only meant to use

37:58.360 --> 38:00.010
the strength you two had.

38:00.960 --> 38:01.900
Your original aim,

38:03.670 --> 38:04.880
our ending,

38:05.070 --> 38:06.400
and the final choice,

38:06.760 --> 38:08.460
they're not the same thing.

38:11.440 --> 38:12.870
I learned skills in Blood River,

38:13.630 --> 38:14.980
and how to be a man from my father.

38:16.550 --> 38:17.490
My father taught me

38:19.840 --> 38:21.090
loyalty comes first.

38:26.710 --> 38:27.740
Loyalty...

38:31.800 --> 38:32.980
When I was young,

38:33.920 --> 38:34.860
I also wanted to found

38:34.880 --> 38:36.300
a different Blood River.

38:39.150 --> 38:40.530
But later I found

38:41.710 --> 38:42.860
I was turning

38:43.880 --> 38:45.300
into one of them.

38:49.320 --> 38:50.090
And you,

38:50.510 --> 38:51.420
Su Muyu,

38:52.960 --> 38:54.050
you're someone

38:54.670 --> 38:56.090
who never changes.

39:03.190 --> 39:03.900
Leave.

39:05.800 --> 39:06.460
Leave.

39:09.000 --> 39:09.940
Once you're gone,

39:10.920 --> 39:12.380
I'll set a great fire

39:14.000 --> 39:15.980
and burn myself and this Nest

39:16.840 --> 39:18.690
to ash.

39:20.110 --> 39:20.980
Say no more.

39:21.590 --> 39:22.980
This is my choice.

39:33.360 --> 39:34.170
Sir...

39:38.150 --> 39:39.170
may you find bliss beyond.

39:49.840 --> 39:51.260
I thought you'd urge me

39:52.360 --> 39:54.130
to seek the miracle physician again.

39:55.550 --> 39:56.170
Everyone has

39:56.360 --> 39:57.300
their choice.

39:59.230 --> 40:00.050
And every choice

40:02.150 --> 40:03.380
has its meaning.

40:12.190 --> 40:13.900
I'll surely fall into hell,

40:15.960 --> 40:17.130
so I hope

40:18.360 --> 40:19.380
we never meet again.

40:35.840 --> 40:37.260
It's been a while. No action yet?

40:38.030 --> 40:38.650
Could the boss have...

40:40.760 --> 40:41.260
Someone's heading in.

40:41.550 --> 40:42.900
Changhe said, wait for his word.

40:44.030 --> 40:44.940
Then whatever happens,

40:44.960 --> 40:46.050
we don't act on our own.

40:51.440 --> 40:52.090
In this world,

40:52.920 --> 40:54.130
you're the only one

40:54.510 --> 40:55.260
I'll give this sword to.

40:57.760 --> 40:58.530
Honestly, I think

40:59.550 --> 41:00.570
you'll find it easier

41:00.590 --> 41:01.420
to win support.

41:02.230 --> 41:03.570
The Twelve Zodiacs of Spider Shadow

41:03.590 --> 41:04.460
can die for you, after all.

41:04.760 --> 41:05.900
While The Other Shore lot

41:06.400 --> 41:07.420
only draw steel on me.

41:08.400 --> 41:09.570
As we agreed:

41:10.000 --> 41:10.780
you be Patriarch,

41:11.150 --> 41:12.260
and I'll head the Su family.

41:18.000 --> 41:18.530
Figures.

41:19.960 --> 41:20.940
Even if I yield to you,

41:20.960 --> 41:21.650
you still won't take it.

41:22.320 --> 41:22.980
Every moment

41:23.030 --> 41:24.300
you want to leave this place,

41:24.670 --> 41:26.730
cut ties with Blood River.

41:29.360 --> 41:31.040
Why do you insist on staying?

41:31.760 --> 41:32.570
Because not everyone

41:32.590 --> 41:34.160
is wantless like you.

41:35.510 --> 41:36.740
Some want to be heroes,

41:37.960 --> 41:39.170
some, knights-errant.

41:40.550 --> 41:41.490
Some want

41:41.490 --> 41:42.930
great wealth,

41:43.470 --> 41:45.340
some want a famous name.

41:45.960 --> 41:47.400
Blood River is strong.

41:48.630 --> 41:49.950
Together,

41:50.280 --> 41:51.940
we can make and change so much.

41:53.000 --> 41:53.780
I have ambition,

41:54.400 --> 41:55.650
and they have desires.

41:56.710 --> 41:57.980
Better than wandering the world,

41:58.070 --> 41:59.300
grip the sword in your hand

42:00.190 --> 42:00.980
and fight to the end

42:01.000 --> 42:02.340
against those bad guys

42:03.150 --> 42:04.260
who'd rule our fate.

42:12.760 --> 42:13.940
Well said!

42:14.360 --> 42:15.610
Kill them all,

42:16.320 --> 42:17.940
and you'll purge this poison for me?

42:18.630 --> 42:19.010
Yes.

42:19.840 --> 42:21.340
They're the Su family's

42:21.360 --> 42:22.570
two strongest:

42:22.880 --> 42:23.900
Su Muyu

42:24.510 --> 42:25.980
and Su Changhe.

42:26.880 --> 42:27.860
You're Water Official

42:28.320 --> 42:28.980
of the Soul Reapers' Hall?

42:29.630 --> 42:31.420
Your speech just now was well put.

42:32.190 --> 42:33.420
Only a pity.

42:34.190 --> 42:34.860
What's the pity?

42:35.440 --> 42:36.130
A pity...

42:37.670 --> 42:39.380
you aren't the one we chose.

42:40.480 --> 42:41.280
Don't worry.

42:41.710 --> 42:42.690
I won't step in.

42:43.280 --> 42:44.400
As one of the Three Officials,

42:44.590 --> 42:45.420
I prefer to watch

42:45.420 --> 42:47.440
from the sidelines.

42:48.000 --> 42:49.260
Strong as you are,

42:50.590 --> 42:51.570
you still won't

42:51.590 --> 42:52.860
be a match for Mu Ciling.

42:53.800 --> 42:54.690
I disagree with much

42:54.710 --> 42:55.900
of what Changhe said,

42:57.190 --> 42:58.380
but one thing

42:59.400 --> 43:00.260
was no empty talk:

43:01.920 --> 43:03.010
together, the two of us

43:03.670 --> 43:04.860
have never lost.

43:05.800 --> 43:06.420
Eighteen-Sword Array,

43:06.670 --> 43:07.050
activate!

43:12.140 --> 43:15.620
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

43:15.660 --> 43:19.540
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

43:21.380 --> 43:24.860
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

43:24.900 --> 43:28.740
♪Surrendering all hues for a glimmer of light♪

43:30.740 --> 43:34.020
♪Through joy and sorrow♪

43:34.140 --> 43:36.220
♪Still I can't let go♪

43:36.380 --> 43:39.820
♪Longing keeps me awake at night♪

43:40.300 --> 43:42.500
♪My heart no longer my own♪

43:42.620 --> 43:47.620
♪No one can escape from love♪

44:04.220 --> 44:07.940
♪How many hidden feelings♪

44:08.060 --> 44:12.140
♪Sink in silence deep?♪

44:13.380 --> 44:17.260
♪Searching through the endless nights♪

44:17.380 --> 44:21.620
♪Struggling on the edge of love and pain♪

44:22.740 --> 44:25.620
